-- ESM MESTA5DEM ABLAN ----------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K0405

`total` met3arraf ablan f scope bayen hena. Kalam mesh beysma7 l ta3reef gedeed yekhabbi ta3reef a2dam, fa el esm leeh ma3na wa7ed f kol wa2t.

2│     khali total = 1
             ----- `total` et3arraf hena el awel
4│         khali total = 2
                 ^^^^^

Garrab: `el_total`

Mosa3da: Edy el ta3reef el gedeed esm khas beeh. W l 2eema men no3 b nafs el esm, el code el 3araby beyzawwed "ال" (`الشكل: شكل`) w code el Franco beyzawwed `el_` (`el_donya: donya`).

E3raf aktar: kalam explain K0405
